Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:41.14,0:17:44.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,还有...想追求梦想
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:46.08,0:17:49.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,將来 因为想学英文 为了去海外留学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:52.08,0:17:55.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,所以想做这工作来努力的
