Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:25.03,0:20:28.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,若被摸头的话 就一招毙命了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:31.04,0:20:34.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,马上就会来做哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:35.04,0:20:38.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,马上就会开心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:38.11,0:20:41.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,能要恩爱的做爱 好好喔的 对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:44.12,0:20:47.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,想黏在一起 想黏在一起？
