Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:44.05,0:21:47.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,1周...有1次没1次的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:49.12,0:21:52.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,那会1做3次啊？若有喝酒的话
