Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:36.07,0:26:39.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,太好了 有做的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:44.08,0:26:47.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,结束了？就这样的 好害羞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:51.08,0:27:54.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,是什么罩杯啊？是H罩杯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:58.15,0:28:01.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,明明曾拼命压住过啊 露出来了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:03.09,0:28:06.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,露出来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:12.04,0:28:15.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,咦？毛...
