Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:28.05,0:28:31.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,一览无遗啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:41.13,0:28:44.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,敏感带请告诉我3个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:46.07,0:28:49.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,那个...乳头
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:53.14,0:28:56.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,和阴蒂...还有什么呢？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:01.15,0:29:04.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,里面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:05.16,0:29:08.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,挺直接的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:10.09,0:29:13.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,最直接的地方会爽的？对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:15.03,0:29:18.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,果然想要人摸那里的？对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:18.10,0:29:21.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,这之后想跟男优怎样做爱？请告诉俄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:22.11,0:29:25.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,那个...因是第一次
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:27.04,0:29:30.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,若能温柔带领我的话 会很开心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:34.12,0:29:37.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,我会加油的
